      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Randolph%2C_Tennessee"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1852, Randolph unsuccessfully tried to move the county seat from Covington, reflecting its brief political ambition.",
