      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Randolph%2C_Tennessee"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "During the Civil War, the Confederacy built Fort Wright in Randolph, a sizable fort that later became a historical landmark.",
